{"id":"vod_sn_36221","vodId":"36221","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"风夏","name_cn":"风夏","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6966187cc100712022d8b88a41262cfc.jpg"},"summary":"榛名优（小林裕介 配音）是刚刚搬到东京来生活的平凡少年，沉默寡言的他个性十分内向，唯有依靠手机来派遣心中的所思所想，所以在外人眼中，榛名优就是一个整天抱着手机的“低头族”。一次偶然之中，榛名优邂逅了名为秋月风夏（Lynn 配音）的少女，和自己不同，风夏竟然连手机都没有，这让榛名优感到十分不可思议。　　风夏是乐队“The fallen moon”的主唱，在她的邀请之下，榛名优加入了乐队成为了贝斯手，一段懵懂的感情在两人之间慢慢酝酿。与此同时，榛名优在网络上和自己曾经青梅竹马的玩伴冰无小雪（早见沙织 配音）重逢了，如今的小雪已经成为了在日本名声大噪的偶像歌手。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y6KvxU5uLW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rir8ZUwQ7s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t1erGFPCGc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e9YX7XzvL21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NbGgrVQu0U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TyVLURiNLX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QDBzRWyGUk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/edVEDBRWbS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xra7JPUSkg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MjeVd04X1L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8KjLEm6kjR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v9tkM6C03G1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.598Z"}